     C*
     C* Every word in the reserved word list the RPG/400 grammar carries.
     C* The RPGLE grammar carries the same list in its own file, and its
     C* own fixtures exercise that copy; this one reaches this copy.
     C*
     C* The words are written into the continuation lines of an embedded
     C* statement, which is where they appear in RPG/400 source. They are
     C* grouped a line at a time rather than into meaningful statements,
     C* because what is being covered is the list itself.
     C*
     C* Member: RPGSQLW  Compilable: no (a word list, not statements)
     C* Source: Reserved words, Db2 for i SQL reference.
     C* Retrieved: 2026-07-28
     C*
     C*
     C* 509 words, 12 to a statement.
     C/EXEC SQL SELECT * FROM SYSIBM.SYSDUMMY1 WHERE 0 = 1
     C+ ABSENT ACCORDING ACCTNG ACTION ACTIVATE ADD ALIAS ALL ALLOCATE
     C+ ALLOW ALTER AND ANY APPEND APPLNAME ARRAY ARRAY_AGG ARRAY_TRIM AS
     C+ ASC ASENSITIVE ASSOCIATE AT ATOMIC ATTACH ATTRIBUTES AUTHORIZATION
     C+ AUTONOMOUS BEFORE BEGIN BETWEEN BINARY BIND BIT BOOLEAN BSON
     C+ BUFFERPOOL BY CACHE CALL CALLED CARDINALITY CASE CAST CCSID CHAR
     C+ CHARACTER CHECK CL CLOSE CLUSTER COLLECT COLLECTION COLUMN COMMENT
     C+ COMMIT COMPACT COMPARISONS COMPRESS CONCAT CONCURRENT CONDITION
     C+ CONNECT CONNECTION CONNECT_BY_ROOT CONSTANT CONSTRAINT CONTAINS
     C+ CONTENT CONTINUE COPY COUNT COUNT_BIG CREATE CREATEIN CROSS CUBE
     C+ CUME_DIST CURRENT CURRENT_DATE CURRENT_PATH CURRENT_SCHEMA
     C+ CURRENT_SERVER CURRENT_TIME CURRENT_TIMESTAMP CURRENT_TIMEZONE
     C+ CURRENT_USER CURSOR CYCLE DATA DATABASE DATAPARTITIONNAME
     C/END-EXEC
     C/EXEC SQL SELECT * FROM SYSIBM.SYSDUMMY1 WHERE 0 = 1
     C+ DATAPARTITIONNUM DATE DAY DAYS DB2GENERAL DB2GENRL DB2SQL DBINFO
     C+ DBPARTITIONNAME DBPARTITIONNUM DEACTIVATE DEALLOCATE DECLARE
     C+ DEFAULT DEFAULTS DEFER DEFINE DEFINITION DELETE DELETING DENSERANK
     C+ DENSE_RANK DESC DESCRIBE DESCRIPTOR DETACH DETERMINISTIC
     C+ DIAGNOSTICS DISABLE DISALLOW DISCONNECT DISTINCT DO DOCUMENT
     C+ DOUBLE DROP DYNAMIC EACH ELSE ELSEIF EMPTY ENABLE ENCODING
     C+ ENCRYPTION END ENDING ENFORCED ERROR ESCAPE EVERY EXCEPT EXCEPTION
     C+ EXCLUDING EXCLUSIVE EXECUTE EXISTS EXIT EXTEND EXTERNAL EXTRACT
     C+ FALSE FENCED FETCH FIELDPROC FILE FINAL FIRST_VALUE FOR FOREIGN
     C+ FORMAT FOUND FREE FREEPAGE FROM FULL FUNCTION GBPCACHE GENERAL
     C+ GENERATED GET GLOBAL GO GOTO GRANT GRAPHIC GROUP HANDLER HASH
     C+ HASHED_VALUE HASH_ROW HAVING HINT HOLD HOUR HOURS ID IDENTITY IF
     C/END-EXEC
     C/EXEC SQL SELECT * FROM SYSIBM.SYSDUMMY1 WHERE 0 = 1
     C+ IGNORE IMMEDIATE IMPLICITLY IN INCLUDE INCLUDING INCLUSIVE
     C+ INCREMENT INDEX INDEXBP INDICATOR INF INFINITY INHERIT INLINE
     C+ INNER INOUT INSENSITIVE INSERT INSERTING INTEGRITY INTERPRET
     C+ INTERSECT INTO IS ISNULL ISOLATION ITERATE JAVA JOIN JSON
     C+ JSON_ARRAY JSON_ARRAYAGG JSON_EXISTS JSON_OBJECT JSON_OBJECTAGG
     C+ JSON_QUERY JSON_TABLE JSON_VALUE KEEP KEY KEYS LABEL LAG LANGUAGE
     C+ LAST_VALUE LATERAL LEAD LEAVE LEFT LEVEL2 LIKE LIMIT LINKTYPE
     C+ LISTAGG LOCAL LOCALDATE LOCALTIME LOCALTIMESTAMP LOCATION LOCATOR
     C+ LOCK LOCKSIZE LOG LOGGED LONG LOOP MAINTAINED MASK MATCHED
     C+ MATERIALIZED MAXVALUE MERGE MICROSECOND MICROSECONDS MINPCTUSED
     C+ MINUTE MINUTES MINVALUE MIRROR MIXED MODE MODIFIES MONTH MONTHS
     C+ NAMESPACE NAN NATIONAL NCHAR NCLOB NESTED NEW NEW_TABLE NEXTVAL NO
     C/END-EXEC
     C/EXEC SQL SELECT * FROM SYSIBM.SYSDUMMY1 WHERE 0 = 1
     C+ NOCACHE NOCYCLE NODENAME NODENUMBER NOMAXVALUE NOMINVALUE NONE
     C+ NOORDER NORMALIZED NOT NOTNULL NTH_VALUE NTILE NULL NULLS NVARCHAR
     C+ OBID OBJECT OF OFF OFFSET OLD OLD_TABLE OMIT ON ONLY OPEN OPTIMIZE
     C+ OPTION OR ORDER ORDINALITY ORGANIZE OUT OUTER OVER OVERLAY
     C+ OVERRIDING PACKAGE PADDED PAGE PAGESIZE PARAMETER PART PARTITION
     C+ PARTITIONED PARTITIONING PARTITIONS PASSING PASSWORD PATH PCTFREE
     C+ PERCENTILE_CONT PERCENTILE_DISC PERCENT_RANK PERIOD PERMISSION
     C+ PIECESIZE PIPE PLAN POSITION PREPARE PREVVAL PRIMARY PRIOR PRIQTY
     C+ PRIVILEGES PROCEDURE PROGRAM PROGRAMID QUERY RANGE RANK
     C+ RATIO_TO_REPORT RCDFMT READ READS RECOVERY REFERENCES REFERENCING
     C+ REFRESH REGEXP_LIKE RELEASE RENAME REPEAT RESET RESIGNAL RESTART
     C+ RESTRICT RESULT RESULT_SET_LOCATOR RETURN RETURNING RETURNS REVOKE
