     C/EXEC SQL SELECT * FROM SYSIBM.SYSDUMMY1 WHERE 0 = 1
     C+ RID RIGHT ROLLBACK ROLLUP ROUTINE ROW ROWNUMBER ROWS ROW_NUMBER
     C+ RRN RUN SAVEPOINT SBCS SCALAR SCHEMA SCRATCHPAD SCROLL SEARCH
     C+ SECOND SECONDS SECQTY SECURED SELECT SENSITIVE SEQUENCE SESSION
     C+ SESSION_USER SET SIGNAL SIMPLE SKIP SNAN SOME SOURCE SPECIFIC SQL
     C+ SQLERROR SQLID SQLIND_DEFAULT SQLIND_UNASSIGNED SQLWARNING STACKED
     C+ START STARTING STATEMENT STATIC STOGROUP SUBSTRING SUMMARY SYNONYM
     C+ SYSTEM_TIME SYSTEM_USER TABLE TABLESPACE TABLESPACES TAG THEN
     C+ THREADSAFE TIME TIMESTAMP TO TRANSACTION TRANSFER TRIGGER TRIM
     C+ TRIM_ARRAY TRUE TRUNCATE TRY_CAST TYPE UNDO UNION UNIQUE UNIT
     C+ UNKNOWN UNNEST UNTIL UPDATE UPDATING URI USAGE USE USER USERID
     C+ USING VALUE VALUES VARIABLE VARIANT VCAT VERSION VERSIONING VIEW
     C+ VOLATILE WAIT WHEN WHENEVER WHERE WHILE WITH WITHIN WITHOUT
     C/END-EXEC
     C/EXEC SQL SELECT * FROM SYSIBM.SYSDUMMY1 WHERE 0 = 1
     C+ WRAPPED WRAPPER WRITE WRKSTNNAME XMLAGG XMLATTRIBUTES XMLCAST
     C+ XMLCOMMENT XMLCONCAT XMLDOCUMENT XMLELEMENT XMLFOREST XMLGROUP
     C+ XMLNAMESPACES XMLPARSE XMLPI XMLROW XMLSERIALIZE XMLTABLE XMLTEXT
     C+ XMLVALIDATE XSLTRANSFORM XSROBJECT YEAR YEARS YES ZONE
     C/END-EXEC
